---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — ExpertNetworks.net">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-accent text-sm font-medium no-underline mb-8 hover:underline">
        &larr; Home
      </a>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">Overview</h2>
        <p>ExpertNetworks.net is a static informational website. We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about any data we collect.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">What We Collect</h2>
        <p>This site does not require accounts, sign-ups, or login. We do not collect personal information such as names, email addresses, or payment details from visitors.</p>
        <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider may collect basic server logs including IP addresses, browser type, and pages visited. These logs are used solely for security monitoring and aggregate traffic analysis.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">Cookies</h2>
        <p>This site does not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or analytics scripts that track individual users. An admin session cookie is used solely for site administration and is not set for regular visitors.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>This site uses Google Fonts for typography, which may result in your browser making requests to Google's servers. We do not use any other third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">External Links</h2>
        <p>When you click a link to an external website (such as an expert network's homepage or a news source), you are subject to that site's privacy policy. We encourage you to review their privacy practices.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated date.</p>

        <p class="text-xs text-tertiary mt-8">Last updated: March 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
